matters, and so do the effort

886
01:22:38,195 --> 01:22:41,422
involved and the student’s experience of
belonging.

887
01:22:42,961 --> 01:22:47,829
Return to page twelve for the masking
discussion. With a partner, consider

888
01:22:47,830 --> 01:22:53,098
