information you need for your role,

920
01:25:31,508 --> 01:25:36,167
rather than seeking a student's
confidential history. Pause here to write

921
01:25:36,168 --> 01:25:36,943
and compare.

922
01:25:44,961 --> 01:25:49,646
Let's come back. What makes your note
useful to the teacher? A time, a context,

923
01:25:49,647 --> 01:25:54,333
an observation and something that helped
can be more useful than a long account

924
01:25:54,334 --> 01:25:58,478
full of interpretations. Use your school's
agreed way of recording and

925
01:25:58,479 --> 01:26:03,345
passing on information. The teacher plans
adjustments; your observations help them

926
01:26:03,346 --> 01:26:08,091
plan and review. If you regularly lack the
information you need to do your role,

927
01:26:08,092 --> 01:26:12,538
raise that through the school's usual
pathway. You can ask what you need to

928
01:26:12,539 --> 01:26:15,841
