fewer words when stress appears. Shorten

1119
01:42:26,045 --> 01:42:30,910
the sentence, offer one piece of
information at a time and wait, rather

1120
01:42:30,911 --> 01:42:35,706
than filling the space with more
instructions. The third is making the

1121
01:42:35,707 --> 01:42:41,198
