1179
01:47:29,487 --> 01:47:34,450
teacher and school processes. The four
review questions are also on page

1180
01:47:34,451 --> 01:47:39,693
nineteen. Does it help the student, or
help the student look typical? Was it

1181
01:47:39,694 --> 01:47:45,356
