Pause now to make your plan.

1245
01:53:39,121 --> 01:53:44,050
Prepare a one-sentence description of the
step you've planned. Does it say what you

1246
01:53:44,051 --> 01:53:48,739
will do less of and what support remains
available? Is the teacher conversation

1247
01:53:48,740 --> 01:53:53,609
clear? Have you included the student and a
